  <section class="czz-section" id="czz-why-cozzia">
    <div class="czz-container">
      <div class="czz-section-header">
        <span class="czz-section-label">The Case for Cozzia</span>
        <h2>Why Serious Buyers Shortlist <span class="czz-underline">Cozzia</span></h2>
        <p>Cozzia earns a place on discerning buyers' shortlists for specific, substantive reasons rooted in technology leadership.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin: 3rem 0; width: 100%; text-align: center;">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0649/9516/4367/files/2_cozzia_ai_tech.jpg?v=1776368954" alt="Cozzia Chair Doctor AI Biometric Technology" 
             style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);">
      </div>
      <div class="czz-pillar-grid">
        <div class="czz-pillar-card"><div class="czz-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-6h2v6zm0-8h-2V7h2v2z"/></svg></div><h3>Chair Doctor&trade; Biometric AI</h3><p>The Quantum and Qi XE Pro feature real-time physiological monitoring — GSR stress sensors, heart-rate (PPG), and blood oxygen (SpO2) — to dynamically adapt the massage to what your body actually needs in the moment.</p></div>
        <div class="czz-pillar-card"><div class="czz-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M11 21h-1l1-7H7.5c-.58 0-.57-.32-.38-.66l5-10.67h1l-1 7h3.5c.49 0 .56.33.47.51L11 21z"/></svg></div><h3>5D Massage Precision</h3><p>The Quantum's 5D system uses 27 real-time pressure sensors to monitor and continuously adjust roller force. This goes beyond standard 4D by responding to resistance changes as you breathe, shift, or tense — delivering a nuanced, body-responsive massage.</p></div>
        <div class="czz-pillar-card"><div class="czz-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2.05v2.02c3.95.49 7 3.85 7 7.93 0 3.21-1.81 6-4.72 7.72L13 17v5h5l-1.22-1.22C19.91 19.07 22 15.76 22 12c0-5.18-3.95-9.45-9-9.95zM11 2.05C5.95 2.55 2 6.82 2 12c0 3.76 2.09 7.07 5.22 8.78L6 22h5v-5l-2.28 2.28C7.81 18 6 15.21 6 12c0-4.08 3.05-7.44 7-7.93V2.05z"/></svg></div><h3>Li Flex Track Architecture</h3><p>The Quantum's two-stage Li Flex Track allows a near-flat 170-degree recline position — enabling true spinal decompression stretching and a more thorough lumbar-to-glute massage path than standard SL-track designs.</p></div>
        <div class="czz-pillar-card"><div class="czz-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 12h-5v5h5v-5zM16 1v2H8V1H6v2H5c-1.11 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L3 19c0 1.1.89 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-1V1h-2z"/></svg></div><h3>Hands-Free Voice Control</h3><p>Built-in voice command compatibility lets you adjust programs, intensity, and position without reaching for a controller — a thoughtful quality-of-life feature that elevates the daily ownership experience.</p></div>
        <div class="czz-pillar-card"><div class="czz-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg></div><h3>Comprehensive Air &amp; Heat Therapy</h3><p>The Quantum's 73-airbag system covers the full body from shoulders to calves. Tri-zone heat therapy in the Qi XE Pro targets the lumbar, glutes, knees, and calves simultaneously — enhancing circulation and muscle recovery beyond what most competitors offer.</p></div>
        <div class="czz-pillar-card"><div class="czz-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v18l4-4h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 14H6l-2 2V4h16v12z"/></svg></div><h3>Thoughtfully Designed Lineup</h3><p>From the accessible Zen 3D Pro to the cutting-edge Quantum, Cozzia's range is focused rather than sprawling — each model occupies a distinct position with a clear purpose, making the buying decision cleaner than with broader lineups.</p></div>
