  <section class="czz-section czz-section-alt" id="czz-faq">
    <div class="czz-container-narrow">
      <div class="czz-section-header center">
        <span class="czz-section-label">Frequently Asked</span>
        <h2>Cozzia Massage Chair <span class="czz-underline">FAQ</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--czz-border)">
        <div class="czz-faq-item"><div class="czz-faq-q" onclick="czzFaq(this)"><h3>Are Cozzia massage chairs worth it?</h3><svg class="czz-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="czz-faq-a"><p>Yes — for buyers who match the right model to their therapeutic need. Cozzia is the only brand in the premium segment with a consumer-level biometric AI system (Chair Doctor&trade;) that reads GSR stress markers, heart rate, and blood oxygen to adapt the massage in real time. For buyers who want intelligent therapeutic response, there is currently no direct competitor.</p></div></div>
        <div class="czz-faq-item"><div class="czz-faq-q" onclick="czzFaq(this)"><h3>What is the best Cozzia massage chair?</h3><svg class="czz-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="czz-faq-a"><p>The "best" Cozzia chair depends on your goals. No-compromise flagship: the Quantum (CZ-800) with 5D massage, Chair Doctor&trade; AI, Li Flex Track, and 73-airbag system. Best 4D AI value: the Qi XE Pro Duo. Best versatile entry: the Zen 3D Pro. We recommend a showroom consultation to identify which suits your therapeutic goals and body type best.</p></div></div>
        <div class="czz-faq-item"><div class="czz-faq-q" onclick="czzFaq(this)"><h3>What is the Chair Doctor&trade; AI system?</h3><svg class="czz-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="czz-faq-a"><p>Chair Doctor&trade; is Cozzia's proprietary biometric monitoring system built into the Quantum and Qi XE Pro. It uses a galvanic skin response (GSR) sensor to measure stress levels, a PPG sensor for heart rate, and an SpO2 sensor for blood oxygen — then adjusts the massage program intensity, rhythm, and focus zones in real time based on your physiological data. No other consumer massage chair offers this level of biometric integration.</p></div></div>
        <div class="czz-faq-item"><div class="czz-faq-q" onclick="czzFaq(this)"><h3>What is the Cozzia Quantum CZ-800?</h3><svg class="czz-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="czz-faq-a"><p>The Cozzia Quantum (CZ-800) is Cozzia's top-tier flagship — featuring 5D massage technology with 27 real-time pressure sensors, Chair Doctor&trade; AI biometric monitoring, a Li Flex two-stage track system (170-degree flat recline), 73-airbag full-body coverage, Monster&trade; 3D surround sound, Cloud Lift positioning support, and a pivoting footrest with stretching capability. It is the most technically advanced chair Cozzia produces.</p></div></div>
        <div class="czz-faq-item"><div class="czz-faq-q" onclick="czzFaq(this)"><h3>Can I try Cozzia massage chairs in San Jose?</h3><svg class="czz-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="czz-faq-a"><p>Yes. House of Massage Chairs carries multiple Cozzia models at our San Jose showroom at Westfield Oakridge Mall and at our Pleasanton location. We schedule dedicated Chair Doctor&trade; evaluation sessions — not just brief sit-downs — so you can experience how the biometric AI adapts to your body over a proper session. <a href="{{ shop.url }}/pages/our-store">Book your visit here.</a></p></div></div>
        <div class="czz-faq-item"><div class="czz-faq-q" onclick="czzFaq(this)"><h3>How does Cozzia compare to Osaki?</h3><svg class="czz-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="czz-faq-a"><p>Osaki leads on model range breadth, feature density, and typically more assertive massage intensity. Cozzia leads on biometric AI intelligence — specifically the Chair Doctor&trade; real-time physiological adaptation. Both are credible premium brands. The right choice depends on whether you prioritize maximum intensity and features (Osaki) or adaptive therapeutic intelligence (Cozzia). Our specialists can walk you through a live comparison at our showroom.</p></div></div>
        <div class="czz-faq-item"><div class="czz-faq-q" onclick="czzFaq(this)"><h3>Do Cozzia chairs come with a warranty?</h3><svg class="czz-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="czz-faq-a"><p>Yes. Cozzia massage chairs include manufacturer-backed warranties covering parts, labor, and frame. The biometric sensor systems carry their own coverage. Coverage terms vary by model tier. HOMC coordinates all warranty claims on your behalf — you never deal with the manufacturer directly.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

